    <TD STYLE="width: 24px; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">1)</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the adoption of the tenth amended and restated memorandum and articles of association of the Company (the <B>&ldquo;Tenth Amended M&amp;A&rdquo;</B>), annexed hereto as Exhibit 99.2, in substitution for, and to the exclusion of, the ninth amended and restated memorandum and articles of association of the Company with effect from the Effective Date, which was previously approved by a unanimous written resolution of the Board passed on 1 July 2026 as authorized by a special resolution passed at the previous extraordinary general meeting held on 8 May 2026, be and is hereby authorised, approved, confirmed and ratified in all respects; and</FONT></TD></TR>
